title: "NAT3D"
abstract: >-
  NAT3D is a professional 3D modeling, CAD, physics simulation, and rendering
  suite written in Rust, with a multi-crate workspace covering geometry, GPU
  rendering (wgpu), physics, animation, and scripting.
type: software
